# HACA Python conventions

- Python 3.12, full type hints; `mypy --strict` must pass for `haca.security.*` and `haca.isapi.*`.
- Pydantic v2 models: `ConfigDict(extra="forbid", frozen=True)` unless a spec says otherwise.
- XML only through `haca.isapi.xml.parse_xml` (defusedxml). YAML only through `yaml.safe_load`.
- HTTP to devices only through `IsapiClient`; no other HTTP clients in `src/` except the Gemini adapter.
- Never log request/response headers or bodies above DEBUG; logs pass through `SecretRedactor`.
- Simulated outputs carry the `SIMULATED` marker.
